test    word ptr ds:536Eh, 800h ; Direct VGA DAC I/O (bypasses BIOS): optionally waits for vertical retrace (port 0x3DA bit 3), writes bl to port 0x3C8 (DAC write address), then cx RGB triples from ds:si to port 0x3C9 (DAC data). The real palette-set primitive.
